{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19107380","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19107380","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910738001:1":{"text":"神堕（かみおち）を回避する方法を見つけたと聞きました。","source_cn":"我听说，你找到了避免神堕的方法？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE70619DB3C459FA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910738002:1":{"text":"ええ。岩礁に腰掛けて、魚の群れを眺めていたら、ふと閃いたの。","source_cn":"是啊，坐在礁石上看鱼群迁徙时，我突然灵机一动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65C89F8BEB398F07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910738003:1":{"text":"でも、それは私にしか使えない方法だと思うわ。それでも知りたい？","source_cn":"那恐怕是只有我才能用的方法。你想知道吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF01D2ACE699E0E06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910738004:1":{"text":"ええ。教えてください。","source_cn":"请告诉我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA41901F84BBC8168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910738005:1":{"text":"私の権能は知っているわね。私は自分を無数のかけらに分けられる。その一つひとつが大海原に流れ込み、独立した命になるの。","source_cn":"你知道我的权能，我可以将自己分化成无数碎片，每一片都会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67571209BD25D5A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910738006:1":{"text":"その間、私は私でなくなる。自分が何者かも忘れ、別々の存在――数多の凡人のように生きることになる。そうなれば、神々を堕落させる悪の根源も、私を見つけ出せないでしょう。","source_cn":"我不再是“我”，我连自己都遗忘，彻底成为另一种存在——...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4100F5FDA1FBEA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910738007:1":{"text":"そうして数百年を過ごした後、眷属の助けで再び神として目覚めるの。そして、見つかる前にまた海へと散る。それを数千万年もの間、繰り返すのよ。","source_cn":"等到沧海桑田，几百年后，我会在眷属的帮助下，以神明的姿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79650B81504C9C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910738008:1":{"text":"それが、あなたが思いついた方法ですか？","source_cn":"这就是你想到的方法？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5225F931674DB747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910738009:1":{"text":"ええ。自分自身を完全に作り替える。それが、これからの私の在り方よ。","source_cn":"是的，我会完全改变自己，那将是我未来存在的方式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16EBA9C1F16CF825","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910738010:1":{"text":"神堕を回避できれば、あなたと戦う理由もなくなるでしょう。これからは数百年ごとにしか会えなくなるけれど、それも一時の夢だと思えば、心置きなく眠りにつけるわ……","source_cn":"避免神堕，就没有兵戈相见的理由。虽然此后相隔数百年才能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31A36892107A2DAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910738011:1":{"text":"私はもう、大切な妹の手が、身内の血に染まるのを見たくないのよ……","source_cn":"我只希望你的双手不再次被亲人的鲜血染红，亲爱的妹妹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA695E486C83091DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910738012:1":{"text":"ですが、そのかけらは、もうあなた自身ではないのでしょう？彼らにも自我が芽生え、感情が生まれ、家族ができる。誰かを愛し、痛みを感じ、自分が消えてしまうことを恐れるはずです！","source_cn":"但那些碎片，他们已经不再是你，他们会拥有自己的意识、情...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD04AA0720304FC9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910738013:1":{"text":"彼らは自分を独立した命だと思っているのに、最後にはあなたの意識に取って代わられてしまう。","source_cn":"你让他们以为自己是独立的生命，却最终要被你的意识取代。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AD4CCBA8D7F1D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910738014:1":{"text":"それは死も同然です、オセアナ。あなたは彼らを殺し……一つの種族を滅ぼすと言っているのですよ！","source_cn":"那对凡人而言是死亡，奥汐娜。在凡人的视野里，你杀了他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x710AC75D29E00A8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910738015:1":{"text":"私のかけらは常人をはるかに超える寿命を持ち、互いに強く結びついている。それに、どんな凡人も恐れないほどの力があるわ。","source_cn":"我的碎片将有超越常人的寿命，彼此间刻入骨髓的链接，以及...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BFF4BB2D14704E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910738016:1":{"text":"彼らは幸せに暮らし、互いを慈しみ、世の理も知らずに生きる……川が大海へと流れ着き、雨粒が潮に溶けゆくまではね。","source_cn":"他们将幸福，友爱，不谙世事……直至最后如河流奔向海洋，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67508CB19B5E8DA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910738017:1":{"text":"分かる？私が生まれる前、彼らは存在しなかった。私が消えた後も、彼らは存在しない。","source_cn":"亲爱的妹妹，你能明白吗？在我之前，他们不存在；在我之后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2664567957449E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910738018:1":{"text":"私は彼らを作ったのではなく、私が彼らそのものなの。取って代わるのではなく、彼らが私になるの。私そのものなのよ。","source_cn":"我没有创造他们，我就是他们；我也不会取代他们，他们会成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD43CA0640F7CC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910738019:1":{"text":"独立した意識を持つ個体にとっては、それは消滅と同じです。","source_cn":"对有独立意识的个体而言，这仍然和消亡毫无区别。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60DD08D322C2B32B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910738020:1":{"text":"なら、あなたはまだ生まれていない数千、数万もの命を奪い、この私を……殺すの？","source_cn":"那么，你要屠杀成千上万还未来得及诞生的生命，以及……我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30D4175CE72C6BFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910738021:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910738022:1":{"text":"ほら、あなたも躊躇したでしょう？何にせよ、一つの方法であるのは間違いないわ。","source_cn":"你犹豫了！无论如何，这都是一种方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F40DE570D96DFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910738023:1":{"text":"これで神堕を免れるのなら、あなたもこれをヒントに、自分を救う方法を見つけられるかもしれない。","source_cn":"如果此举真能避免神堕的话，妹妹，也许你也可以受到启发，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7DAAF32B9261C4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910738024:1":{"text":"私も、神堕の運命からは逃れられないと？","source_cn":"你觉得我也会迎来神堕的命运？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE344572DC735CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910738025:1":{"text":"私たちは原罪を背負う神なのだから。何が起きてもおかしくないでしょう。でも大丈夫、私が助けになるわ。","source_cn":"作为背负了原罪的神明，我觉得什么都可能发生哦？不过不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DB91D8BA8F2ED0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910738026:1":{"text":"什么？","source_cn":"什么？","status":"ambiguous_source_text","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910738027:1":{"text":"あなたが、自分の権能を真に発揮する方法を探しているのは知っているわ。","source_cn":"我知道你在找能真正实行自己权能的方法，亲爱的妹妹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DEE5BF48E4DC9DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910738028:1":{"text":"心を完全に閉ざせないあなたは、仲間の命を奪う罪を重ねるたび、魂に傷を負っていく。今や、その魂は傷だらけよ。","source_cn":"你没能完全封闭自己的心，夺去同胞生命的罪行在给你的灵魂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7159B0A821AF01E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910738029:1":{"text":"でも、あなたがこれまで何をしてきたとしても、私はずっとあなたの姉として、力になるわ。","source_cn":"而不管你曾经做过什么，我都是你的姐姐——永远是你的姐姐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DD23BBEE2145FCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1910738030:1":{"text":"だから、そのお返しとして、今回は私の願いを聞いてくれるかしら？","source_cn":"作为回报，这次可以听听我的愿望吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB05566A62C6FD9C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1910738031:1":{"text":"分か